hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/shop/silk\">Silk Sarees</a><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/shop/organza\">Organza</a><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/collections/signature-edit\">Heritage Edit</a><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/size-guide\">Size Guide</a></nav></div><div class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"group inline-block\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-widest text-brand-charcoal font-semibold uppercase group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\">ROYAL SILKS</span><span class=\"block text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] font-sans text-brand-muted uppercase -mt-1\">Boutique Storefront</span></a></div><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 md:space-x-6 text-brand-charcoal\"><button class=\"p-2 hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors focus:outline-none\" aria-label=\"Search\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search w-5 h-5\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></button><a class=\"relative p-2 hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/wishlist\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart w-5 h-5\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></a><button class=\"relative p-2 hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors focus:outline-none\" aria-label=\"Shopping Cart\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-bag w-5 h-5\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"></path><path d=\"M3 6h18\"></path><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 max-w-3xl space-y-10\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-2 border-b border-brand-border pb-6\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-gold uppercase\">Boutique Guarantee</span><h1 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl text-brand-charcoal font-medium\">Shipping &amp; Returns</h1><p class=\"text-xs text-brand-muted\">Transparent delivery timelines, insured transit, and hassle-free returns.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-8 text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed\"><section class=\"bg-brand-surface p-6 border border-brand-border space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-brand-charcoal uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold mr-2\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> Shipping &amp; Dispatch Policy</h2><p>• <strong>Domestic Shipping:</strong> All domestic orders within India ship via express air courier (Shiprocket / Blue Dart). Orders over ₹10,000 qualify for complimentary express delivery.</p><p>• <strong>Dispatch Timelines:</strong> Standard sarees dispatch within 24 to 48 hours of order confirmation. Custom pre-stitched or tailored blouse orders dispatch within 4 to 6 business days.</p><p>• <strong>Transit Duration:</strong> Metro cities: 2–3 business days. Rest of India: 3–5 business days.</p></section><section class=\"bg-brand-surface p-6 border border-brand-border space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-brand-charcoal uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-refresh-cw w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold mr-2\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8\"></path><path d=\"M21 3v5h-5\"></path><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16\"></path><path d=\"M8 16H3v5\"></path></svg> 7-Day Easy Return &amp; Exchange Policy</h2><p>• We offer a hassle-free 7-day return policy from the date of package delivery.</p><p>• Items must be unwashed, unworn, with all original Silk Mark tags intact in original boutique packaging.</p><p>• Custom stitched blouses or fall-piku finished sarees are non-returnable unless defective.</p></section></div></div></main><footer class=\"bg-brand-charcoal text-brand-base border-t border-brand-charcoal/20 pt-16 pb-12 font-sans\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 md:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-brand-border/20\"><div><span class=\"font-serif text-2xl tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-base block font-semibold\">ROYAL SILKS</span><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-brand-base/70\">Curated luxury Indian sarees handcrafted by master weavers across Kanchipuram, Varanasi, and Chanderi. Timeless drapes for life’s most cherished celebrations.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center space-x-4 text-xs text-brand-gold\"><span>✓ Silk Mark Certified</span><span>✓ Handloom Authenticity</span></div></div><div><h4 class=\"font-serif text-sm tracking-wider uppercase text-brand-gold mb-4\">Storefront</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs text-brand-base/80\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/shop\">Shop All Sarees</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/shop/silk\">Kanjeevaram &amp; Banarasi Silk</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/shop/organza\">Organza &amp; Tissue</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/collections/signature-edit\">Heritage Collection</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/size-guide\">Blouse Size Identifier</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/track-order\">Order Tracking</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"font-serif text-sm tracking-wider uppercase text-brand-gold mb-4\">Customer Care</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs text-brand-base/80\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/shipping-and-returns\">Shipping &amp; Delivery</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/shipping-and-returns\">Returns &amp; Exchanges</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Boutique Concierge Contact</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/privacy\">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/terms\">Terms of Service</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\" href=\"/refund-policy\">Refund Policy</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"font-serif text-sm tracking-wider uppercase text-brand-gold mb-4\">Boutique Circle</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-brand-base/70 mb-4\">Subscribe to receive private collection previews, silk care guides, and exclusive festive invitations.</p><form class=\"flex\"><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your email address...\" class=\"w-full bg-brand-base/10 border border-brand-border/30 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-b